  "description": "Ji-Woo, the owner of a car center and former racing car mechanic, has a strange regular customer who visits his shop after closing time: Bin, a former race car driver and former teammate. Ever since, Bin, who has had a crush on Ji-Woo, has a penchant for womanizing, and on race days, he uses the pretext of relieving his post-race excitement by having passionate sex with Ji-Woo at his car center. One day, Ji-Woo, who has been waiting for Bin, begins to feel resentful that Bin only satisfies his desires and then leaves without a trace, and the desire to torment her by having sex with her begins to sprout.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
